# Railway deploys the backend, and the service's Root Directory is "backend".
#
# That means `railway up` has to run from the repo root — the uploaded source
# must contain a backend/ folder for the service to find. Running it from
# inside backend/ uploads that folder's *contents*, so Railway looks for
# backend/backend and the build fails with:
#
#   Root directory "backend" was not found in the deployed source
#
# Deploying from the root would otherwise upload the whole monorepo, so
# everything the API does not need is excluded here.

frontend/
mobile/
graphify-out/
docs/
android-release/

node_modules/
**/node_modules/

